      "surface": "議題",
      "reading": "ぎだい",
      "reason": "議題 (gidai) more accurately translates 'agenda' in the sense of 'list of items to be discussed at a meeting', which is the core meaning of the English lemma. 日程 (nittei) primarily means 'schedule' or 'program of events', which is a narrower aspect of 'agenda'."
    }
